  m_text: The centre of the scene features a refractive sphere.In the normal view
    the original object is visible. When the "Show mirror scene" button is pressed,
    the deformed mesh and refractive sphere appear, allowing the view of the deformed
    mesh through the refractive object. By using the "Ray Tracer" panel on the right,
    we can fly to the perspective of the camera. Through the pixel screen, we are
    able to see the reflection of the object on the mirror surface. The reflection
    should look similar to the original object, referenced behind the mirror. To
    see an unobstructed view of the object and its reflection, click on "Render image".
